error[keywords]: `uint32` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:2:14
   │
 2 │ typedef long uint32;
   ·              ^^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_uint32`

error[keywords]: `octet` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:3:17
   │
 3 │ typedef boolean octet;
   ·                 ^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_octet`
